+# Chat UI Test Pages
+
+Comprehensive test pages for all chat interface components and AI elements using the unified F.B/c design token system.
+
+## Pages
+
+### 🚀 COMPLETE CHAT (`/chat-ui-test/complete`) 🆕
+**Full, functional chat interface with everything integrated:**
+- Real message input and sending
+- All AI Elements in action (Response, Reasoning, Sources, Code, Tools, Actions)
+- Multimodal controls (voice, camera, screen share)
+- Live theme switching
+- Flat variant (official modern pattern)
+- Interactive controls and state management
+
+### 🎯 ALL-IN-ONE (`/chat-ui-test/all`)
+**Complete test suite in one page with 8 mega-tabs:**
+- Overview, Themes, Chat UI, AI Elements, Vercel Patterns, Terminal, Media, Tools
+- All 9 chat components + 20+ AI elements + 7 themes
+- Quick links to individual detailed pages
+
+### 1. Main UI Components (`/chat-ui-test`)
+Tests the core chat interface components (8 tabs):
+- **Overview**: List of all available components + design token showcase
+- **Design Tokens**: Complete design system with colors, typography, sizes, and helpers
+- **Terminal**: Terminal aesthetic for monochrome themes (CLI/terminal styling)
+- **Header**: Chat header with minimize/expand/close controls
+- **Inputs**: Chat suggestions and terms acceptance UI
+- **Media**: Voice button and floating media controls
+- **Features**: ChatInput, attachments, reactions, streaming, editing, typing, read receipts
+- **Container**: Full chat container with responsive states
+
+### 2. AI Elements (`/chat-ui-test/ai-elements`)
+Tests all AI elements used in chat messages (4 tabs):
+- **Messages**: Basic message, loader, suggestions
+- **Interactive**: Actions, reasoning, sources, context
+- **Content**: Code blocks, artifacts, images, web previews
+- **Advanced**: Chain of thought, tools, tasks, citations
+
+### 3. Vercel Official Patterns (`/chat-ui-test/vercel-patterns`)
+Tests AI Elements following [Vercel's official patterns](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements) (5 tabs):
+- **Conversation**: Auto-scroll, empty state, scroll button
+- **Message**: Variants (contained/flat), with avatars, with Response component
+- **Interactive**: Reasoning, Sources, Actions (icon buttons with tooltips), Context
+- **Tools**: All 4 tool states (streaming, available, complete, error)
+- **Advanced**: Complete message composition with all elements
+
+### 4. Theme System (`/chat-ui-test/themes`)
+Tests all 7 themes with automatic terminal aesthetics:
+- **Orange Light/Dark**: Modern UI with orange-500 accent, rounded corners
+- **Monochrome Light/Dark**: Terminal/CLI aesthetic with prompts, sharp edges (pure grayscale)
+- **Terminal Orange Light/Dark**: Terminal aesthetic with orange accent (best of both!)
+- **System**: Auto-detect from OS preferences
+
+## Components Tested
+
+### Main Chat Components (9)
+1. `ChatInterface` - Main chat wrapper
+2. `ChatContainer` - Responsive container with positioning
+3. `ChatHeader` - Header with state controls
+4. `ChatInput` - Message input (planned)
+5. `ChatMessages` - Message display with all AI elements
+6. `ChatSuggestions` - Prompt suggestions
+7. `ChatTermsAcceptance` - Terms and user info UI
+8. `VoiceButton` - Voice control button
+9. `FloatingMediaControls` - Voice/camera/screen controls
+
+### AI Elements (20+)
+1. `Actions` - Actionable buttons
+2. `Artifact` - Generated artifacts
+3. `ChainOfThought` - Step-by-step reasoning
+4. `CodeBlock` - Syntax-highlighted code
+5. `Context` - Contextual information
+6. `Conversation` - Conversation wrapper
+7. `Image` - Image display
+8. `InlineCitation` - Text citations
+9. `Loader` - Loading indicator
+10. `Message` - Message display
+11. `Reasoning` - Expandable reasoning
+12. `Sources` - Reference sources
+13. `Suggestion` - Suggested prompts
+14. `Task` - Task management
+15. `Tool` - Tool usage display
+16. `WebPreview` - Rich link previews
+17. And more...
+
+## Usage
+
+### Development
+```bash
+pnpm dev:all
+```
+
+Then navigate to:
+- **http://localhost:3000/chat-ui-test/complete** - 🚀 FULL CHAT (fully functional!) 🆕
+- **http://localhost:3000/chat-ui-test/all** - 🌟 ALL-IN-ONE (component showcase)
+- http://localhost:3000/chat-ui-test - Main UI components (8 tabs)
+- http://localhost:3000/chat-ui-test/ai-elements - AI Elements library (4 tabs)
+- http://localhost:3000/chat-ui-test/vercel-patterns - Vercel official patterns (5 tabs)
+- http://localhost:3000/chat-ui-test/themes - Theme system test (7 themes)
+
+### Testing States
+
+#### Chat States
+- **Open/Closed**: Toggle chat visibility
+- **Minimized**: Compact header-only view
+- **Normal**: Standard chat window
+- **Expanded**: Full-screen mode
+
+#### Media States
+- **Voice**: Active, muted, processing
+- **Camera**: Active/inactive with preview
+- **Screen**: Active/inactive with preview
+
+#### Message States
+- **Empty**: No messages, show suggestions
+- **Loading**: Show loading indicator
+- **Messages**: User and assistant messages
+- **Enhanced**: Messages with AI elements
+
+## Component Props
+
+### ChatHeader
+```typescript
+interface ChatHeaderProps {
+  chatState: ChatState;
+  onToggleMinimize: () => void;
+  onToggleExpand: () => void;
+  onToggleChat: () => void;
+}
+```
+
+### VoiceButton
+```typescript
+interface VoiceButtonProps {
+  disabled?: boolean;
+  isActive?: boolean;
+  isProcessing?: boolean;
+  isMuted?: boolean;
+  error?: string | null;
+  onToggle?: () => void;
+}
+```
+
+### FloatingMediaControls
+```typescript
+interface FloatingMediaControlsProps {
+  // Voice state
+  isVoiceActive: boolean;
+  isVoiceProcessing: boolean;
+  isVoiceSupported: boolean;
+  isMuted: boolean;
+  voiceError?: string;
+  onToggleVoice: () => void;
+  
+  // Camera state
+  isCameraActive: boolean;
+  cameraError?: string;
+  onToggleCamera: () => void;
+  
+  // Screen share state
+  isScreenSharing: boolean;
+  screenShareError?: string;
+  onToggleScreenShare: () => void;
+  
+  // Media streams
+  cameraStream: MediaStream | null;
+  screenShareStream: MediaStream | null;
+  
+  // UI state
+  isExpanded: boolean;
+}
+```
+
+## Design Token System
+
+All components use the unified design token system from `/src/components/chat/design-tokens.ts`:
+
+### Key Principles
+1. **Colors**: Use `bg-orange-500` (not custom HSL) for F.B/c brand
+2. **Fonts**: Apply via inline `style={fontStyle.x}` (not className)
+3. **Corners**: Use `rounded-md` for sharp aesthetic
+4. **Orange**: Used for ALL active states (voice, camera, loading)
+5. **Consistency**: Single source of truth for all styling
+
+### Usage
+```tsx
+import { CHAT_DESIGN, fontStyle, chatStyles, COLORS } from '@/components/chat/design-tokens'
+
+// Colors
+<div className={COLORS.ORANGE.bg} />
+
+// Typography (inline style)
+<h1 style={fontStyle.display}>Title</h1>
+<p style={fontStyle.sans}>Body text</p>
+<code style={fontStyle.mono}>Code</code>
+
+// Pre-built helpers
+<div className={chatStyles.orangeDot} />
+<div className={chatStyles.userBubble}>Message</div>
+
+// Sizes
+<Button className={SIZES.TOGGLE_BUTTON} />
+```
+
+## Notes
+
+- All components use the unified design token system
+- Orange accent (orange-500) for F.B/c brand
+- Fonts: Space Grotesk (display), Inter (sans), JetBrains Mono (mono)
+- Components support dark/light theme
+- Responsive design with mobile-first approach
+- Accessibility features included
+- Animation with Framer Motion
+
+## Future Enhancements
+
+- [x] Add ChatInput component implementation
+- [x] Add real-time message streaming
+- [x] Add attachment preview
+- [ ] Add emoji picker (integrated in ChatInput)
+- [x] Add message editing
+- [x] Add message reactions
+- [x] Add typing indicators
+- [x] Add read receipts
+
+All features now have visual demos in the **Features** tab!
+
